    {
      "content": "<p>Go-karting has become an exciting and fun pastime for locals and tourists alike in Bangalore. There are various tracks across the city, hence giving different experiences-thence it's natural that this activity will be enjoyed from adrenaline junkies to families carrying kids. No matter if you’re a beginner or an experienced racer, there’s something for everyone in this vibrant city.<br></p><h2>Key Takeaways</h2><ul><li><b>Variety of Tracks:</b> Bangalore has many tracks for go-karting and has a variety of different track lengths as well as different varieties of karts.</li><li><b>Family-Friendly:</b> Several destinations provide additional entertainment venues, hence it is a great destination for a family.<br></li><li><b>Safety First:</b>They ensure that safety is practiced by having well-maintained karts and trained staff.<br></li><li><b>Affordable Fun:</b> Prices vary, but there are something for everyone.<br></li></ul><h2><b>Top Places for Go-Karting in Bangalore</b></h2><p></p><h3><b>1. Meco Kartopia</b></h3><b><br></b><p></p>",
      "type": "text-block"
    },
    {
      "content": "<p>Located on Hennur-Bagalur Road, <span style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 255);\">Meco Kartopia</span><span style=\"color: rgb(156, 0, 255);\"><a href=\"https://www.mecomotorsports.co.in/Mecokartopia\" target=\"_blank\"></a></span> is one of the premier go-karting venues in Bangalore. The circuit stretches over 1.2 km with sharp turns and high-speed straights to give the fun adrenaline rush for all.<br></p><table data-theme=\"{\" themename\":\"theme1\",\"themeobj\":{\"tblpr\":{\"cell\":{\"borders\":{\"border-top\":{\"color\":\"\",\"width\":\"1px\",\"type\":\"solid\"},\"border-right\":{\"color\":\"\",\"width\":\"1px\",\"type\":\"solid\"},\"border-left\":{\"color\":\"\",\"width\":\"1px\",\"type\":\"solid\"},\"border-bottom\":{\"color\":\"\",\"width\":\"1px\",\"type\":\"solid\"}}}}}}\"=\"\" data-cols=\"[{\" wt\":\"2.115in\"},{\"wt\":\"4.896in\"}]\"=\"\" data-width=\"7.01in\" data-table-name=\"Table_1\" class=\"zw-table\" data-doc-id=\"3105201000000768003\" style=\"margin-left: 0in;\" data-doc-type=\"writer\"><tbody><tr data-row-info=\"{\" id\":\"rw-2q364md9x7h7\",\"type\":\"row\"}\"=\"\"><td class=\"zw-td\" col-index=\"0\" data-cell-height=\"auto\" style=\"border-right-width: 0px; border-bottom-width: 0px; border-color: rgb(0, 0, 0) rgb(229, 231, 235) rgb(229, 231, 235) rgb(0, 0, 0); padding: 0px; vertical-align: bottom; width: 203.04px; height: auto;\"><p data-header=\"0\" class=\"zw-paragraph heading0\" data-textformat=\"{\" fgc\":\"rgb(0,=\"\" 0,=\"\" 0)\",\"size\":\"10.50\",\"type\":\"text\"}\"=\"\" data-margin-bottom=\"12pt\" data-hd-info=\"0\" data_styles=\"{\" data-line-height=\"1.2\" style=\"margin-right: 0px; margin-bottom: 12pt; margin-left: 0px; line-height: 1.2;\"><span style=\"font-family: Roboto; font-size: 10.5pt; vertical-align: baseline;\">&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; </span><span style=\"vertical-align: baseline;\">&nbsp; &nbsp;<font face=\"Roboto\"><span style=\"font-size: 10.5pt;\">Feature&nbsp;</span></font></span></p></td><t