12pt; margin-left: 0px; line-height: 1.2;\"><span style=\"vertical-align: baseline;\">                                                    ₹300 to ₹700 for 6 laps</span></p></td></tr></tbody></table><h3><b>3.Red Riders Go-Karting</b></h3>",
      "type": "text-block"
    },
    {
